Maz Scourgeheart is a powerful Charr Shaman who conducts dark elemental rituals deep beneath Ascalon. He is responsible for creating the elementals that roam the [[Forsaken Tunnels]], assembling them into a growing army intended to break through the [[Great Northern Wall]]. Cunning and confident in his magic, Maz taunts intruders and views them as prey for his newly forged forces. His ambition and ritual power make him a significant threat to Ascalon’s safety until he is defeated.

