==Trivia==
* He is presumably a member of the Scourge [[warband]], along with [[Wyle Brimscourge]].
* Along with [[Magmus]], [[Freezie]], [[Fronis Irontoe]], and [[Varny the Zealot]], Maz is one of the only dungeon end foes to be a boss (all others are [[boss-like foes]]).
* Maz is one of only two bosses encountered before [[the Searing]] that use an [[elite skill]], the other being [[Vatlaaw Doomtooth]].
